"The following is a diff from the previous accessibility tree for Window: \"Privacy Policy — Flagstone\" with ~ and + representing changed and added elements, respectively. Removed elements are summarized by ID range.\nRemoved element IDs: 133, 135-136, 138-153, 155-179, 181, 184-186, 188, 190-207, 209-218\n~17 standard window Privacy Policy — Flagstone - Google Chrome for Testing, URL: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/, Secondary Actions: Raise\n~\t18 container Privacy Policy — Flagstone - Google Chrome for Testing, URL: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/\n~\t\t\t\t\t27 text field (settable) Description: Address and search bar, Value: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/, Placeholder: Search Google or type a URL\n~\t\t\t114 HTML content Privacy Policy — Flagstone, URL: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/\n~\t\t\t\t115 link Description: Skip to main content, Value: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/#main\n~\t\t\t\t\t124 heading Privacy Policy, Value: 1\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t125 text Privacy Policy\n~\t\t\t\t\t126 text Last updated: July 31, 2026  |  Version 1.1\n~\t\t\t\t\t132 text Short version:\n+\t\t\t\t\t133 text  We collect only what’s needed to make the map work. We never sell your data. You can delete your account any time from your Profile — your personal details go, and anything you contributed stays only with your name removed.\n~\t\t\t\t\t134 heading Overview, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t135 text Overview\n+\t\t\t\t\t136 text Flagstone is a community tool for mapping accessibility barriers. This policy explains what we collect, why, and how to control your information.\n~\t\t\t\t\t137 heading What We Collect, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t138 text What We Collect\n+\t\t\t\t\t139 heading When you browse the map (no account needed), Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t140 text When you browse the map (no account needed)\n+\t\t\t\t\t141 text Nothing.\n+\t\t\t\t\t142 text  You can view flags without logging in and we don’t track you.\n+\t\t\t\t\t143 heading When you create an account, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t144 text When you create an account\n+\t\t\t\t\t145 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t146 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t147 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t148 text Email address  — for sign-in and optional notifications only\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t149 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t150 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t151 text Display name  — shown on flags you verify or report (you choose this)\n+\t\t\t\t\t152 heading When you report or verify a flag, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t153 text When you report or verify a flag\n~\t\t\t\t\t154 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t155 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t156 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t157 text Location  — the latitude/longitude where you submit the flag (placed on the map)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t158 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t159 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t160 text Description  — the text you write about the accessibility barrier\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t161 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t162 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t163 text Category  — which type of barrier (ramp, parking, etc.)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t164 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t165 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t166 text Severity  — how much of a problem it is (1-5 scale)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t167 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t168 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t169 text Photos  — if you choose to add them\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t170 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t171 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t172 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t173 text GPS metadata is  automatically removed  from all photos before they’re stored\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t174 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t175 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t176 text Camera metadata, timestamps, and other EXIF data are stripped before upload\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t177 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t178 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t179 text We keep only the image itself, not the metadata\n~\t\t\t\t\t180 heading Automatically collected, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t181 text Automatically collected\n~\t\t\t\t\t182 text Almost nothing. There is no usage analytics and no crash reporting in the app: nothing about how you use it is collected, transmitted, or stored.\n~\t\t\t\t\t183 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t184 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t185 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t186 text Timestamps  — when you created your account and when you take actions\n~\t\t\t\t\t187 heading What we never collect, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t188 text What we never collect\n~\t\t\t\t\t189 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t190 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t191 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t192 text Analytics about how you use the app, or which screens you visit\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t193 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t194 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t195 text Crash or error reports\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t196 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t197 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t198 text Your device’s location in the background\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t199 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t200 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t201 text Contacts, camera roll, or other device data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t202 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t203 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t204 text Payment information (we don’t charge)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t205 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t206 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t207 text GPS coordinates or camera metadata from your photos\n~\t\t\t\t\t208 heading How We Use Your Data, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t209 text How We Use Your Data\n+\t\t\t\t\t210 table\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t211 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t212 column header\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t213 text Your Data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t214 column header\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t215 text What We Do With It\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t216 column header\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t217 text Who Sees It\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t218 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t219 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t220 text Email\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t221 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t222 text Sign-in, password reset, optional notifications\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t223 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t224 text Only you (never visible on the map)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t225 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t226 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t227 text Display name\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t228 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t229 text Shown on flags you report/verify\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t230 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t231 text Other app users\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t232 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t233 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t234 text Flag location\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t235 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t236 text Placed as a marker on the map\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t237 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t238 text Other app users\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t239 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t240 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t241 text Flag description + category\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t242 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t243 text Shown on the map when people tap the marker\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t244 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t245 text Other app users\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t246 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t247 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t248 text Photos\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t249 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t250 text Displayed in flag details (public-readable in Storage)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t251 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t252 text Other app users\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t253 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t254 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t255 text Usage data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t256 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t257 text Fixing bugs, improving the app, understanding feature adoption\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t258 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t259 text Internal team only\n+\t\t\t\t\t260 text We do not:\n+\t\t\t\t\t261 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t262 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t263 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t264 text Sell or share your data with third parties (except our cloud provider, Supabase, which is contractually bound)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t265 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t266 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t267 text Use your data for advertising\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t268 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t269 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t270 text Share your email with other users\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t271 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t272 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t273 text Analyze your flag history to profile you\n+\t\t\t\t\t274 heading Your Rights & Controls, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t275 text Your Rights & Controls\n+\t\t\t\t\t276 heading Manage Your Account, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t277 text Manage Your Account\n+\t\t\t\t\t278 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t279 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t280 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t281 text Edit your profile  — change display name or avatar anytime in Settings\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t282 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t283 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t284 text Delete a flag  — remove any flag you submitted via the flag’s detail screen\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t285 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t286 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t287 text Manage notifications  — opt in/out anytime in Settings\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t288 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t289 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t290 text Delete your account  — Profile > Delete Account\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t291 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t292 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t293 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t294 text Your account and personal details go — email, display name, avatar\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t295 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t296 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t297 text Reports and comments you contributed may stay in the app with your name removed, so the community’s record of barriers stays whole\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t298 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t299 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t300 text Photos attached to your reports may remain unless you delete the report itself first\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t301 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t302 AXListMarker ◦ \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t303 text This action cannot be undone\n+\t\t\t\t\t304 heading Data Access & Portability, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t305 text Data Access & Portability\n+\t\t\t\t\t306 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t307 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t308 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t309 text See your data  — all your personal data is visible in the app (profile, flags, activity)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t310 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t311 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t312 text Export data  — contact us at \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t313 link Description: support@skypistudio.com, Value: mailto:support@skypistudio.com\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t314 text  to request a copy of all your data\n+\t\t\t\t\t315 heading Privacy by Region, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t316 text Privacy by Region\n+\t\t\t\t\t317 text GDPR  If you’re in the EU/EEA:\n+\t\t\t\t\t318 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t319 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t320 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t321 text Right to access  — request a copy of your data via the contact email below\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t322 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t323 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t324 text Right to erasure  (“right to be forgotten”) — use Delete Account in-app, or contact us\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t325 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t326 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t327 text Right to restrict processing  — contact us to restrict how we use your data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t328 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t329 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t330 text Right to portability  — request your data in a portable format (CSV, JSON)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t331 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t332 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t333 text Right to object  — contact us to object to certain data uses\n+\t\t\t\t\t334 text CCPA  If you’re in California:\n+\t\t\t\t\t335 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t336 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t337 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t338 text Right to know  — request what personal information we collect about you\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t339 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t340 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t341 text Right to delete  — use Delete Account in-app, or contact us\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t342 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t343 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t344 text Right to opt-out  — we do not sell personal information\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t345 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t346 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t347 text Right to non-discrimination  — we won’t discriminate for exercising your rights\n+\t\t\t\t\t348 text PIPEDA  If you’re in Canada:\n+\t\t\t\t\t349 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t350 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t351 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t352 text Right to access  — request a copy of your personal data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t353 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t354 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t355 text Right to correction  — ask us to correct inaccurate data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t356 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t357 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t358 text Right to complaint  — contact the Privacy Commissioner of Canada if you believe we’ve violated PIPEDA\n+\t\t\t\t\t359 heading How We Store & Protect Your Data, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t360 text How We Store & Protect Your Data\n+\t\t\t\t\t361 heading Storage Location, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t362 text Storage Location\n+\t\t\t\t\t363 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t364 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t365 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t366 text Your data is stored by  Supabase , our cloud database provider\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t367 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t368 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t369 text Data is  encrypted at rest  (AES-256) and  in transit  (TLS 1.2+)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t370 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t371 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t372 text Passwords are never stored — managed by Supabase Auth\n+\t\t\t\t\t373 heading Data Retention, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t374 text Data Retention\n+\t\t\t\t\t375 table\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t376 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t377 column header\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t378 text Type of Data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t379 column header\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t380 text How Long We Keep It\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t381 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t382 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t383 text Account (email, display name, avatar)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t384 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t385 text Until you delete your account\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t386 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t387 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t388 text Flags you submit\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t389 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t390 text Until resolved + 90 days (then archived)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t391 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t392 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t393 text Flag photos\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t394 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t395 text Until the flag is deleted\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t396 row\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t397 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t398 text Audit logs (for security)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t399 cell\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t400 text 30 days\n+\t\t\t\t\t401 heading Third-Party Services, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t402 text Third-Party Services\n+\t\t\t\t\t403 heading Supabase (Cloud Database & Storage), Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t404 text Supabase (Cloud Database & Storage)\n+\t\t\t\t\t405 text We use Supabase to host our database and file storage. Supabase is contractually bound to protect your data under GDPR/CCPA. \n+\t\t\t\t\t406 link Description: Supabase Privacy Policy (opens in new tab), Value: supabase.com/privacy\n+\t\t\t\t\t407 heading Expo / EAS (App Distribution), Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t408 text Expo / EAS (App Distribution)\n+\t\t\t\t\t409 text We use Expo Application Services to build and distribute the app. Expo may receive your device type and app version during updates. \n+\t\t\t\t\t410 link Description: Expo Privacy Policy (opens in new tab), Value: expo.dev/privacy\n+\t\t\t\t\t411 heading OpenStreetMap Nominatim (Address Search), Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t412 text OpenStreetMap Nominatim (Address Search)\n+\t\t\t\t\t413 text When you type into the address-search field, the text you type is sent to OpenStreetMap’s Nominatim service to look up the place. That search text is the only thing Nominatim receives — no account details, no device identifiers, and never your GPS location. \n+\t\t\t\t\t414 link Description: OSM Foundation Privacy Policy (opens in new tab), Value: osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy\n+\t\t\t\t\t415 heading No Other Sharing, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t416 text No Other Sharing\n+\t\t\t\t\t417 text We do not share data with advertisers, analytics companies, or data brokers. We will not sell your data under any circumstance.\n+\t\t\t\t\t418 heading Photo Privacy Details, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t419 text Photo Privacy Details\n+\t\t\t\t\t420 text When you upload a photo:\n+\t\t\t\t\t421 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t422 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t423 AXListMarker 1. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t424 text We re-process the image to strip all EXIF metadata (GPS coordinates, timestamps, camera model, lens info)\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t425 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t426 AXListMarker 2. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t427 text On iOS/Android: we use the device’s native media library for re-processing\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t428 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t429 AXListMarker 3. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t430 text On web: we use canvas to re-render, which naturally strips all metadata\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t431 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t432 AXListMarker 4. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t433 text Photos are stored in Supabase Storage with  public read access  — anyone on the map can see them\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t434 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t435 AXListMarker 5. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t436 text Only you can delete your photos\n+\t\t\t\t\t437 heading Children & Minors, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t438 text Children & Minors\n+\t\t\t\t\t439 text Flagstone is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we learn that we’ve collected data from a child under 13, we’ll delete it immediately. If you believe a child under 13 has created an account, please contact us at \n+\t\t\t\t\t440 link Description: support@skypistudio.com, Value: mailto:support@skypistudio.com\n+\t\t\t\t\t441 text .\n+\t\t\t\t\t442 heading Changes to This Policy, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t443 text Changes to This Policy\n+\t\t\t\t\t444 text If we make material changes, we will update the “Last updated” date, notify you via in-app message and email, and ask you to re-accept the new policy if required.\n+\t\t\t\t\t445 heading Contact & Data Requests, Value: 2\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t446 text Contact & Data Requests\n+\t\t\t\t\t447 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t448 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t449 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t450 text Email:\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t451 link Description: support@skypistudio.com, Value: mailto:support@skypistudio.com\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t452 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t453 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t454 text Response time:  We aim to respond within 30 days\n+\t\t\t\t\t455 text For data subject requests (GDPR / CCPA / PIPEDA), include one of the following in your email subject line:\n+\t\t\t\t\t456 content list\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t457 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t458 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t459 text Data Subject Access Request  — to see your data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t460 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t461 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t462 text Data Deletion Request  — to delete your data\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t463 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t464 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t465 text Data Portability Request  — to export your data\n+\t\t\t\t466 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t467 container Site\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t468 text Flagstone\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t469 text   |  \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t470 link Description: Support, Value: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/support/\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t471 text   |  Privacy Policy  |  \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t472 link Description: Accessibility, Value: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/accessibility/\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t473 text   |  \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t474 link Description: Terms & Community Guidelines, Value: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/terms/\n+\t\t\t\t\t475 text © 2026 Flagstone. All rights reserved.\n~\t\t\t\t\t65 tab (selected, settable, boolean) Description: Privacy Policy — Flagstone, Value: on\nThe focused UI element is 114 HTML content Privacy Policy — Flagstone, URL: 127.0.0.1:4405/flagstone/privacy/"